		<title>Abdul El-Sayed&#8217;s victory in Michigan propels &#8216;Medicare for All&#8217; debate</title>
		<link>https://bridgemi.com/michigan-health-watch/abdul-el-sayeds-victory-in-michigan-propels-medicare-for-all-debate/</link>
		
